{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0144_1000_p", "source_sha256": "68b8c16cf79d85344150373a64fceeecd3d7964de18c6c95090755ca17303a32", "ja": "（今日の仕事は、PV撮影。闘牛士風の衣装を着た\n奈緒が余裕ある表情で、カメラを見つめている……）", "zh": "（今天的工作是拍摄PV。穿着斗牛士风格服装的奈绪，神情从容地凝视着镜头……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0144_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "0bad8184bfe61600a06fe7899aa8e0754c8eda69ab80615102ec14252ef336e6", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\n今のシーン、どうでしたか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n刚才那一幕，感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0144_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1b0a65bceda34f8dd60cbc3e34a1cca40ccb7ae6503ae48c6ae9f0fb0da9d3d5", "ja": "お疲れさま、奈緒。\nうん、クールな雰囲気で、様になってたよ！", "zh": "辛苦了，奈绪。\n嗯，气氛很酷，很有模有样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0144_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "3ec698a29a9088394b16cf5bffb9d1232962100b2de632bdf201e5db1660267a", "ja": "ふふーん、当然ですよ。私、スペインについて、\nアニキからメッチャ聞いてきましたから！", "zh": "哼哼，当然啦。我可是从大哥那里听说了好多关于西班牙的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0144_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "2fd4be998d1515fbdbb1a8f4f6e4fd76b6d5cc87e5da9b58de4f24ab7ba4c43e", "ja": "本場のスペインの風を感じたつもりで、\nこの撮影、私にまかせたってください！", "zh": "就当作感受到了西班牙本土的风，\n这次拍摄就交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0144_1005_p", "source_sha256": "23199162423d9472fd3e1e0b959d83384d465a86c84c8aaca51c389c84c1265b", "ja": "へえ……奈緒のお兄さんは、スペインに詳しいのか？", "zh": "诶……奈绪的哥哥很了解西班牙吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0144_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "0bd30e72af9ac87979db11374df6ba0b6bb3f34cd9ccd7b2721a53efadf7e652", "ja": "詳しいんかどうかはようわからないんですけど、\nなんや、メッチャ熱く語ってましたよ？", "zh": "我也不太清楚他算不算熟悉，\n不过他讲起来超级起劲的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0144_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "99aa2d476e32413d40b7492e09be9b3ed6de7b2f4d1fcee0709b8b82a960e69a", "ja": "私が「今度闘牛士風のPV撮影する」って言うたら、\n「スペインについて教えてやる」って言うてきて……。", "zh": "我说\"下次要拍斗牛士风格的MV\"，他就说\"我来给你讲讲西班牙\"……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0144_1008_p", "source_sha256": "fa99caa7c594e4c0635bb4bd1c4bb1e8062a66bff653ddeeba6d19dce085ab2b", "ja": "もしかして、奈緒のお兄さんが言うスペインって\nサッカーの話なんじゃ……まぁいいか。", "zh": "奈绪你哥哥说的西班牙，\n该不会是指足球吧……算了，无所谓了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0144_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "1165bbb5e00e4cd61638b901f4c1ef11359068b7b88448194fc68a4af111a974", "ja": "あれっ、なんか違いました？\nでもスペイン料理って、メッチャおいしいんですね！", "zh": "咦？好像不太对吗？不过西班牙菜真的超级好吃呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0144_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "721074f530b081f1d3b7affb93f1fa50377c35817bbdbb173862a14686b2ca44", "ja": "アニキが、スペインの人がやってるっていう\nスペイン料理の店に連れてってくれたんですよ。", "zh": "大哥带我去了一家据说是西班牙人开的西班牙餐厅。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0144_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "649003ad07b22a5de1d51681589128189513238b3702ef1e567c2e9228f9032b", "ja": "そこのパエリアが絶品で。{$P$}さん\nにも、食べてもらいたかったわ～。", "zh": "那里的西班牙海鲜饭特别好吃。也想让{$P$}先生尝尝呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0144_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ef534b7ee9b41090d921026efe0a267db3c3cbdb90db74fb43a020e8e5f14b49", "ja": "へえ、そうなのか。\n本場仕込みのパエリアか……美味しそうだな。", "zh": "哦，是这样啊。\n正宗西班牙风味的海鲜饭啊……听起来真好吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0144_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "cf0dd417268c36fc5df8e201cc1d341a376bf4be4fb6febcac413c8a6e783f78", "ja": "タコ飯があんなオシャレになるなんて、\nさすがスペインやな～って。", "zh": "没想到章鱼饭也能变得那么时髦，果然不愧是西班牙啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0144_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "ecd07efccd6be3b3888a332d4929ee8be49c229ee1729ca01dc2b0cc6f66099e", "ja": "まぁでも、世界一のタコ料理はやっぱり\nたこ焼きですけどね！", "zh": "不过，要说世界第一的章鱼料理，果然还是章鱼烧嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0144_1015_p", "source_sha256": "4f829bef592909b2573036204dba00beaa916f7f329e203f06e1150350962570", "ja": "奈緒のたこ焼きは美味しいもんな。\nでも、そうか……。", "zh": "奈绪做的章鱼烧确实很好吃呢。\n不过，这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0144_1016_p", "source_sha256": "6e1087117e5e8e93b44db7175416e88a4753c06afaca2058fd21c09180d2e07e", "ja": "今日の奈緒がいつもよりクールに見えたのは、\nお兄さんのパエリアのおかげかもしれないな？", "zh": "今天的奈绪看起来比平时更酷，说不定是多亏了你哥哥做的西班牙海鲜饭？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0144_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "d1f618df89b7077634273c4bed03453bc11287b3ce846a1d4ebdde9c9768924f", "ja": "あっ、そうかも。やとしたら、アニキの情報が\n雰囲気作りの役に立ったってことですよね！", "zh": "啊，还真有可能。这样的话，也就是说，阿尼基提供的信息帮上营造氛围的忙了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0144_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "795f08e20375c206a230f5d4c958cfaf7b9e9dd309fa5693b1d1f1c336c3ee8e", "ja": "これは、アニキになんかお礼せんとやんな……\n何にしよう。たこ焼きでええかな……。", "zh": "这下可得好好谢谢大哥才行……  \n送什么好呢。章鱼烧怎么样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0144_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "313acddddbd2488adf20e6617024425dcf0c3a4d910efd1f39b6816944c6f8e6", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、どうです？\nパエリアのお礼に、たこ焼きパーティー！", "zh": "{$P$}先生也一起来怎么样？\n为了答谢海鲜饭，来开章鱼烧派对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0144_1020_037nao", "source_sha256": "d00bda02635d4f10b9c87a61b23a7b84670a9ab1948bacc00965a85e91b156e8", "ja": "私が腕によりをかけますから、味は保証しますよ！", "zh": "我会使出浑身解数的，味道绝对有保证！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
